## Model card

- **Name:** Leanstral 1.5 (119B-A6B)
- **Short description:** Mistral's open-source code agent purpose-built for Lean 4 theorem proving / verified program reasoning (perfectoid spaces, Rust-fragment properties). Built on the Mistral Small 4 family; Apache 2.0; expert model for formal verification, not a general chat model.
- **Provider / access:** Open weights on Hugging Face (`mistralai/Leanstral-1.5-119B-A6B`); Mistral Vibe CLI (`vibe --agent lean`); vLLM ≥0.24 local serving; lean-lsp-mcp integration; chat.mistral.ai Labs opt-in.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released ~Oct 2026 ("updated model of Leanstral-2603"); knowledge cutoff not stated.
- **IDs:** `mistralai/Leanstral-1.5-119B-A6B` (HF); `leanstral` (Mistral Vibe agent)
- **Context window:** 256K tokens (≤200K recommended); max output configurable (32K in examples).
- **Modalities:** text + image in; text out; reasoning yes (`none`/`high` effort, high recommended); tool calls yes (lean-lsp-mcp, Vibe).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Apache 2.0 open weights — self-host free; Mistral API free plan (Labs opt-in) for hosted access.
- **Architecture:** MoE, 119B total / 6.5B active, 128 experts (4 active).

